r":false,"text":"He is a boy who lives in a Western-style mansion on the outskirts of town and carries a somewhat mature air. With an aloof, hard-to-grasp personality, he comes across as curt and sarcastic. Strongly responsible by nature, he possesses a sharp intellect along with decisiveness and the ability to act. Having lost his memories of the past, he works as a detective while searching for clues to recover who he once was."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c102451"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街外れの洋館に住む、どこか大人びた雰囲気を持つ少年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飄々とつかみ所のない性格。無愛想で皮肉屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"責任感が強く、明晰な頭脳と決断力、行動力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去の記憶を失っており、探偵業の傍ら記憶を取り戻すため手がかりを探している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26075","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街外れの洋館に住む、どこか大人びた雰囲気を持つ少年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飄々とつかみ所のない性格。無愛想で皮肉屋。責任感が強く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明晰な頭脳と決断力、行動力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去の記憶を失っており、探偵業の傍ら記憶を取り戻す手がかりを探す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「約束したんだ。二度と苦しませたりしないと」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"152452"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e7e58439a9f60a3af094b16d935eb6f9352e50f24a16ee3fdc3b518a78f7ff25.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a291f4e7864395457f1513828b7b60b620470f972cfc5560b007201b745f3fa9.webp","width":222,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c31871","characterName":"マヤ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63694","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26076"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31871"},"originalCharacterName":"マヤ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If you had to choose between two things that are both important to you… what would you do?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a quiet girl with a fragile, almost fleeting aura. Extremely taciturn and rarely showing her emotions on the surface, she is nevertheless deeply passionate on the inside. Once she opens her heart to someone, she becomes completely devoted to them. She serves as the chairwoman of the academy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31871"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かで、儚げな雰囲気をもつ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極端に無口で感情をあまり表に表わさないが、内面は情熱的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度心を許した相手には献身的につくすタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の理事長を務めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26076","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かで、儚げな雰囲気をもつ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極端に無口で感情をあまり表に表わさないが、内面は情熱的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度心を許した相手には献身的につくすタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の理事長を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大切な二つのもの、どちらか選択するとしたら……どうする？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63694"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed73d217200f94c175bef4ac43dee06ceaa151593e2a333e2add245011681ca9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0b460bf2157b95b64cb34b2c5c849dd442fd0edfda530e2e3434790a7dc67ab.webp","width":203,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:63694:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31872","characterName":"カレン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63695","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26080"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31872"},"originalCharacterName":"カレン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I knew it all along. But I was afraid to admit it.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is strong-willed and stubborn, with a sharp tongue that is second to none. However, she also has a fragile side—easily hurt, quick to tears, and prone to loneliness. Her pride often gets in the way of being honest with her feelings, but once she opens her heart to someone, she suddenly becomes very affectionate and dependent. Because she helps care for orphans at a church, she is actually quite skilled at cooking."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31872"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強くて意地っ張りで、口の悪さは一級品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし打たれ弱い一面もあり、涙もろく寂しがり屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドが邪魔をしてなかなか素直になれないが一度心を許すと途端に甘えだすタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会で孤児たちの世話をしていることもあって、実は料理が得意。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26080","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強くて意地っ張りで、口の悪さは一級品。しかし打たれ弱い一面もあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"涙もろく寂しがり屋。プライドが邪魔をしてなかなか素直になれないが、一度心を許すと途端に甘えだすタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会で孤児たちの世話をしていることもあって、実は料理が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「本当は気づいてた。でも、認めるのが怖かった」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63695"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/768ad03aedb8f6da9ff3678b7dd9f405653bcdb3fbbef645325a071dc1e13856.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98d3ae2c719613a43311744b93b48252ec4512d93ddc2ff06d3762c769483e36.webp","width":215,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あおきさやか","creatorId":"vndb:s194","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s194","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s194","name":"あおきさやか(青木静香)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:63695:4869:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31873","characterName":"ミウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63696","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26077"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31873"},"originalCharacterName":"ミウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Just as I thought, you really were exactly the kind of person I believed you were.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a girl who brightens her surroundings with a gentle, warm atmosphere simply by being there. With her easygoing personality, she even has the peculiar “talent” of tripping over nothing at all. Although she wishes to be independent, she naturally stirs protective instincts in those around her, and people often find themselves taking care of her. Because of her kindness, she tends to carry her worries alone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31873"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"その場にいるだけで周囲を明るく優しい雰囲気にしてしまう少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格で、何もない場所で転ぶ特技を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は自立したいと考えているのだが、周りにいる者の保護欲を刺激し、何かと世話を焼かれてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その優しさゆえに、悩みを一人で抱え込んでしまう傾向がある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26077","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"その場にいるだけで周囲を明るく優しい雰囲気にしてしまう少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格で、何もない場所で転ぶ特技を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は自立したいと考えているのだが、周りにいる者の保護欲を刺激し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かと世話を焼かれてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その優しさゆえに、悩みを一人で抱え込んでしまう傾向がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「やっぱり、あなたは私が思っていた通りのひとでした」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63696"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1dc09e13fa8cf981a20669bbe5cc05502752e7cd6ba841c7046e27e3cf5ac858.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2b5a516c8640c36037ce43a59157ebeb5c0aced7a8bedc68d6ce0a73db4aa43.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:63696:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31876","characterName":"ハノン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152456","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26079"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31876"},"originalCharacterName":"ハノン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Go home. Never come near milady again.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of Miu’s guardians—a tall, slender, and strikingly beautiful woman who dresses in masculine attire. The restaurant where she works attracts a large number of female fans. Her manner of speaking is also very masculine, and she bluntly says even things that are difficult to voice. She takes pride in serving as Miu’s bodyguard, and her skill with knives is first-rate."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31876"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミウの保護者。すらりとした長身の男装の麗人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"働いているレストランには数多くの女性ファンが訪れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調も男っぽく、言いにくいことでもずけずけと口にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミウのボディガードを自負しており、ナイフの腕は一流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミウにとって兄、父親的存在。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26079","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/237f4099973c34e06595aabdb4f3683e23ee1249db7107e605bb656b9d8889da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e238e09cb29029dae3f175ecfb6d76c50ce4fc80baaf4fbe77ea8c7f0ac7f2a.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:152456:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31877","characterName":"ナツキ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152458","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26082"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31877"},"originalCharacterName":"ナツキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Next time, I’ll definitely kick you out!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of the twins under Karen’s care and Riona’s younger sister. Possessing an adult-like level of drive and initiative, she is never able to sit still. Strong-willed and stubborn, she also has a soft side and is quick to tears. Though she can be a bit selfish at times, she is weak when it comes to Karen and Riona. Her glasses are her defining charm point."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31877"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレンが面倒を見ている双子の一人。リオナの妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人顔負けの行動力を持ち、じっとしていることがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強く意地っ張りだが、涙もろい一面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少しわがままなところがあるが、カレンとリオナには弱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眼鏡がチャームポイント。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26082","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9faf5fc2a2ee792b94373cf99e91f9fdd7c94384d03e442219bd3ba98a910257.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70af1743cab1a5700a841356de7cb78932174b20e9010fa041e5fe2fec9053e8.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"吉田愛理","creatorId":"vndb:s757","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s757","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s757","name":"如月葵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:152458:6037:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31878","characterName":"レイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152455","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26078"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31878"},"originalCharacterName":"レイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“No, that won’t do. What if germs get in?”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of Miu’s guardians, an older sister–like woman who wears a maid’s uniform. Gentle and warm-hearted, she has a deeply nurturing personality and an abundance of emotional generosity. Her skills in cooking, laundry, cleaning, and all household chores are professional-level. Polite and considerate toward everyone, she is easy to get along with. To Miu, she is both an older sister and a motherly presence."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31878"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハノン同様、ミウの保護者。　メイド服がポイント。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おだやかな性格で、包容力あふれる女性であり料理洗濯掃除と家事はすべてプロ級の腕前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、誰に対しても丁寧な物腰で人当たりがいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハノンとは逆に男性に多くのファンがいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミウにとっては姉、母親的存在な人である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26078","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccd16b4e308016dbd85f8ac539480d462f52ddcea25f92c4041e722769e853c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fbcc45a5b28dad76ee38269d2cbf78da0cdd61b55c85011cf3a93c418805383a.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"文月かな","creatorId":"vndb:s54","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s54","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s54","name":"文月 かな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:152455:22926:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31879","characterName":"リオナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152457","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"81402"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26081"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31879"},"originalCharacterName":"リオナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Natsuki, I think that’s going too far…\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of the twins under Karen’s care and Natsuki’s older sister. Quiet and shy, she is the type who keeps to herself and loves reading books. Although she may appear absent-minded at first glance, she is actually thoughtful and perceptive, often acting as the one who keeps Natsuki’s impulsive behavior in check. She looks up to Karen and adores her like an older sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31879"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレンが面倒を見ている双子の一人。ナツキの姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かで人見知りするタイプ。本を読むのが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見ぼんやりしているように見えるが実は思慮深く暴走気味のナツキの手綱を握る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレンを姉のように慕っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26081","sourceWorkId":"6591","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bcb4cf2a92da5d1f70da1716d23edb962e5f047def348c8fcce59dac02a8ea5a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05375a21fddd9438c954cf9cdf20a7cb7d3df00bef95c6b129688c5744e6fe69.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鳴海エリカ","creatorId":"vndb:s112","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s112","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s112","name":"鳴海 エリカ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:81402:152457:4489:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31874","characterName":"マリネオ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31874"},"originalCharacterName":"マリネオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“If you’re a gentleman, then this is the moment when you should gently extend a helping hand!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A doll of a silver-haired girl that follows Maya and guides Nayuta. She is slightly airheaded, and her way of speaking ends with the refined “~desu no.” While Marineo and Jajas switch between playing the fool and the straight man depending on the situation, Marineo is generally the one handling the jokes."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31874"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/73f78057e0620334fecdc09e349a24ea917